"description":"Feeling disconnected from your natural rhythm? Sona helps you understand YOUR unique timing patterns and align your daily life with peak energy windows.\n\nUnlike generic advice, Sona creates a personalized map of your inner cycles , showing you WHEN to take action, rest, connect, and manifest. Set daily intentions that actually stick because they're aligned with your natural flow.\n\nYour internal compass knows the way. Let Sona help you read it.\n\nWHAT MAKES SONA DIFFERENT\n\n• PERSONAL TIMING INSIGHTS\nReceive daily guidance tailored to YOUR unique profile. No cookie-cutter advice.\n\n• INTENTION SETTING\nSet meaningful goals aligned with your peak energy moments.\n\n• CYCLE TRACKING\nUnderstand your personal rhythms across days, weeks, and months.\n\n• DAILY RITUALS\nBuild a consistent practice with guided prompts and reflections.\n\n• SELF-DISCOVERY TOOLS\nUncover patterns in your energy, mood, and productivity.\n\n• AI COMPANION\nMeet Sona: your personal guide who learns your patterns and grows with you.\n\nWHO IS SONA FOR?\n\n• People seeking deeper self-understanding\n• Those who feel \"off\" but can't explain why\n• Intention-setters and manifestation practitioners\n• Anyone curious about personal timing and cycles\n• Mindfulness enthusiasts looking for personalized guidance\n\nSTART YOUR JOURNEY\n\nDownload Sona today and discover what happens when you align your daily life with your natural rhythm.\n\nQuestions? Reach us at support@roguelabs.nyc\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://roguelabs.nyc/privacy\nEULA: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\n\nSONA REQUIRES AN ACTIVE SUBSCRIPTION.", "minimumOsVersion":"17.2", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.63332999999999994855670593096874654293060302734375, "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"60335104", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":120, "trackContentRating":"4+", 
