nsoredName":"Sona: AI Music & Cover Maker", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/sona-ai-music-cover-maker/id6503645134?uo=4", "averageUserRating":4.3679199999999998027533365529961884021759033203125, "currentVersionReleaseDate":"2025-11-16T09:48:25Z", "artistId":1694018202, "artistName":"SUNRAY MOBILE LTD", "genres":["Music", "Lifestyle"], "price":0.00, "trackId":6503645134, "trackName":"Sona: AI Music & Cover Maker", "bundleId":"com.sonaai.app", "genreIds":["6011", "6012"], "releaseDate":"2024-06-02T07:00:00Z", "primaryGenreName":"Music", "primaryGenreId":6011, "sellerName":"SUNRAY MOBILE LTD", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "version":"5.0.8", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"【AI Song Generator: Transform Ideas into Music】\nWelcome to Sona AI, the AI song generator that turns your lyrics, ideas, or prompts into fully produced songs. Whether you’re looking to write a song, create a custom track, or generate lyrics with ease, Sona AI offers an intuitive and innovative approach to music creation.\n\n【Generate Songs from Prompts】\nWith Sona AI, you can transform any prompt into a unique song. From catchy pop melodies to soulful ballads, our AI crafts songs that reflect your desired genre, mood, and style. Whether you input your own lyrics or use the lyric generator for inspiration, our system will build a complete, high-quality song tailored to your vision.\n\n【Custom Song Creation】\nUse our powerful AI to create a custom song written for you in minutes. Add vocals and intricate melodies to your track or let Sona AI build everything from scratch. It’s not just a song maker—it’s your creative partner that brings your music to life with stunning results.\n\n【AI Music Generator: Create Music with AI Precision】\nSona AI offers more than just lyrics and songs; it’s a full AI music generator that allows you to produce music in a wide range of genres and styles using simple prompts. Whether you’re interested in creating rhythms, melodies, or full instrumental pieces, Sona AI seamlessly converts text-based prompts into complete musical works.\n\n【Generate Beats and Moods】\nLeverage our beat creator and music maker features to produce intricate rhythms or mood-specific compositions. While Sona AI isn’t a traditional music editing tool, it excels at creating new songs, beats, and instrumentals through advanced music AI capabilities, all based on your input.\n\n【From Idea to Melody】\nSimply describe what you want to create—be it an upbeat track, a relaxing instrumental, or a moody ballad—and let our music generator handle the rest. The entire process is seamless, allowing you to make beats or create a song without technical complexity.\n\n【AI Cover: Sing with Your Own Voice】\nWith our AI Cover feature, you can now perform songs using your own voice. Train Sona AI with your vocal data, and it will reproduce any generated song as if you were singing it yourself. Whether it’s a custom composition or a recreated classic, this feature gives you full vocal presence—without ever stepping into a studio.\n\n【Share Your Creations】\nOnce your masterpiece is ready, share your songs with friends, family, or on social media. Impress your audience with personalized music generated by AI music creation. Every track is uniquely crafted to reflect your individual style, thanks to our lyric generator, song writer AI, and more.\n\n【Why Choose Sona AI?】\nEffortlessly write a song or create a track with our AI song writer.\n Utilize AI music generation tools for creating beats, melodies, and vocals.\nReproduce songs with your own trained voice using the AI Cover feature.\nGenerate engaging music, from simple rhythms to complex songs, all from a single prompt.\nExperience Sona AI and unlock a new way of making music.\n\nNote: All features, including AI Cover, custom track creation, and advanced music generation tools, require premium access.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://sunraymobile.net/sonaai/privacy.html\nTerms & Conditions: https://sunraymobile.net/sonaai/terms.html\nEULA: https://sunraymobile.net/sonaai/eula.html\nSupport: info@sunraymobile.net", "minimumOsVersion":"15.6", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.3679199999999998027533365529961884021759033203125, "languageCodesISO2A":["CA", "NL", "EN", "FI", "FR", "DE", "ID", "IT", "JA", "KO", "MS", "NB", "PL", "PT", "RO", "RU", "ES", "SV", "TH", "TR"], "fileSizeBytes":"57516032", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":424, "trackContentRating":"4+", "sellerUrl":"https://sunraymobile.net/sonaai", "releaseNotes":"What's new:\n• Refined UI for smoother workflow\n• Faster generation with improved engine performance\n• Major bug fixes for greater stability", "userRatingCount":424}, 
